TEXT sec=s1 slot=eyebrow text="Weekly Loaf"
TEXT sec=s1 slot=title text="Bread [worth the walk]"
TEXT sec=s1 slot=lede text="Two ovens and no cafe." ACTION sec=s1 slot=primary label="Collection times" href="#times" ACTION sec=s1 slot=secondary label="Contact us" href="#contact" MEDIA sec=s1 slot=figure motif=elevation
SECTION  id=s2  kind=features  layout=list  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s2 slot=eyebrow text="The Weekly Loaf"
TEXT sec=s2 slot=title text="Sourdough [starts at dawn]"
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Monday" body="Whole wheat and rye, baked in the morning shift."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Wednesday" body="Seeded sourdough, ready for pickup by one pm sharp."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Friday" body="Rustic country loaf, limited to twenty units per batch."
ITEM sec=s2 slot=item title="Sunday" body="Classic white bread, the first tray goes into the oven at six am."
SECTION  id=s3  kind=detail  layout=split  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s3 slot=eyebrow text="The Secret"
TEXT sec=s3 slot=title text="No [cafe] to wait in."
TEXT sec=s3 slot=lede text="We bake exactly what the queue can eat, then we shut the door. The silence after noon is our promise that you won't be left standing with a cold bagel while strangers sip coffee around us."
ACTION sec=s3 slot=primary label="Check today's limit" href="#times"
MEDIA sec=s3 slot=figure motif=elevation
SECTION  id=s4  kind=faq  layout=stack  tone=bold
TEXT sec=s4 slot=eyebrow text="Common Questions"
TEXT sec=s4 slot=title text="How [do I] get my bread?"
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="When do you open?" body="We unlock the door at seven am on weekdays and eight thirty on weekends. The first tray hits the oven before we let anyone in, so be ready to queue by then."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="What if I miss my window?" body="If your shift ends or work runs late past noon, you cannot pick up a fresh loaf from us that day. We do not hold orders for later; the remaining stock goes straight into charity bins at one pm sharp."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="How much does it cost to join?" body="There is no membership fee and we never charge by the gram or ounce. You pay a fixed price per loaf that covers flour, yeast, water, electricity, rent, and our time making them for you."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Can I order online in advance?" body="No phone calls please; we do not take pre-orders over the internet because every single crumb is baked to exact demand. If it does not sell out by noon, we simply stop baking that day and close up shop for good."
ITEM sec=s4 slot=item title="Where can I pick my bread?" body="Collection happens only at our front counter in Bristol; there are no delivery vans or drop-off points elsewhere. Bring your own bag if you want to save a few pence, as we do not sell plastic bags on site."
SECTION  id=s5  kind=cta  layout=stack  tone=quiet
TEXT sec=s5 slot=title text="Come before noon"
TEXT sec=s5 slot=lede text="The ovens shut down at one pm."
ACTION sec=s5 slot=primary label="#times" href="#times"
